  <nav class="about3-nav" aria-label="About page sections"><div class="about3-shell about3-nav-inner"><a class="active" href="#about-story">Our story</a><a href="#about-purpose">Vision &amp; mission</a><a href="#about-founder">The beginning</a><a href="#about-leadership">Leadership</a><a href="#about-ethics">Our ethics</a></div></nav>

  <section class="about3-section" id="about-purpose"><div class="about3-shell">
    <div class="about3-section-head"><div><div class="about3-eyebrow">Why we exist</div><h2>A more thoughtful way to discover India.</h2></div><p>Behind every conscious product is a person, a purpose and a story worth knowing. We are building a connected ecosystem that gives makers visibility, helps responsible brands grow and makes better choices easier for customers.</p></div>
    <div class="about3-story-grid"><article class="about3-story-card"><p>Indian craft and maker-led businesses carry generations of knowledge, but many still struggle to reach the right audience. Conscious India brings their products, stories and values together in a platform designed for discovery and trust.</p><p>Our work connects commerce, events, collaborations and storytelling—so recognition can become sustainable opportunity.</p></article><div class="about3-purpose"><article><i class="fa-regular fa-eye"></i><h3>Our vision</h3><p>To make Indian craft and conscious living a global choice.</p></article><article><i class="fa-solid fa-bullseye"></i><h3>Our mission</h3><p>To present Indian craft, design and maker-led brands to wider audiences through curation, commerce, experiences and storytelling.</p></article></div></div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="about3-section soft" id="about-founder"><div class="about3-shell about3-founder">
    <figure class="about3-founder-image"><img src="assets/images/team/deepesh-barua.jpeg" alt="Deepesh Barua, Founder and COO" loading="lazy"></figure>
    <div class="about3-founder-copy"><div class="about3-eyebrow">The beginning</div><h2>It began with his mother. It grew into a larger purpose.</h2><span class="about3-role">Deepesh Barua · Founder &amp; COO</span><p>In 2024, Deepesh began this journey after seeing the barriers women face while building independent livelihoods. What started as a desire to create better opportunities for women-led businesses revealed a wider challenge.</p><p>India has extraordinary makers and responsible brands, but many lack visibility, consistent growth and access to the right markets.</p><div class="about3-quote">A listing or a single exhibition can create attention. A connected ecosystem can create lasting opportunity.</div><p>Conscious India was shaped to bridge that gap—turning discovery into relationships, stories into trust and visibility into sustainable growth.</p></div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="about3-section" id="about-leadership"><div class="about3-shell">
    <div class="about3-section-head"><div><div class="about3-eyebrow">The people</div><h2>Leadership shaped by different journeys.</h2></div><p>Our team brings together business, product, design and technology with one shared commitment: helping India's makers and conscious brands reach people who value their work.</p></div>
    <div class="about3-team-grid">
      <article class="about3-team-card"><div class="about3-team-image"><img src="assets/images/team/preeti-gaikwad.png" alt="Preeti" loading="lazy"></div><div class="about3-team-body"><h3>Preeti</h3><span class="about3-role">Co-Founder &amp; CEO</span><p>With 17+ years across SaaS, biotech sales and entrepreneurship, Preeti leads growth, partnerships and market access.</p></div></article>
      <article class="about3-team-card"><div class="about3-team-image"><img src="assets/images/team/pooja-gj.jpeg" alt="Pooja G J" loading="lazy"></div><div class="about3-team-body"><h3>Pooja G J</h3><span class="about3-role">Co-Founder &amp; CPO</span><p>An architect and maker, Pooja leads product, curation and the experience that connects every object with the hands behind it.</p></div></article>
      <article class="about3-team-card"><div class="about3-team-image"><img src="assets/images/team/huns-pujita.jpg" alt="Huns Pujita" loading="lazy"></div><div class="about3-team-body"><h3>Huns Pujita</h3><span class="about3-role">Co-Founder &amp; CDO · Digital &amp; Brand</span><p>Pujita brings technology, design and storytelling together to shorten the distance between a maker and a conscious customer.</p></div></article>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="about3-section soft" id="about-ethics"><div class="about3-shell">
    <div class="about3-ethics-intro"><div><div class="about3-eyebrow">What guides us</div><h2>The 11 Ethics of Conscious India</h2></div><p>These principles guide what we promote, who we partner with and how we build trust. Open any principle to read what it means in practice.</p></div>
    <div class="about3-ethics">
      <div class="about3-ethic"><button type="button" aria-expanded="true"><span class="about3-ethic-num">01</span><span class="about3-ethic-title">Conscious Consumption First</span><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></button><div class="about3-ethic-panel">Encourage mindful purchasing and products that create positive environmental and social impact.</div></div>
      <div class="about3-ethic"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="about3-ethic-num">02</span><span class="about3-ethic-title">Sustainability by Authenticity</span><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></button><div class="about3-ethic-panel">Support responsible sourcing, production, packaging and logistics while rejecting greenwashing.</div></div>
      <div class="about3-ethic"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="about3-ethic-num">03</span><span class="about3-ethic-title">Support for Indian Artisans &amp; Heritage</span><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></button><div class="about3-ethic-panel">Preserve traditional crafts, indigenous knowledge and artisan livelihoods through fair market access.</div></div>
      <div class="about3-ethic"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="about3-ethic-num">04</span><span class="about3-ethic-title">Fair Trade &amp; Artisan Empowerment</span><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></button><div class="about3-ethic-panel">Promote equitable earnings, visibility and opportunity for artisans and rural entrepreneurs.</div></div>
      <div class="about3-ethic"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="about3-ethic-num">05</span><span class="about3-ethic-title">Vegan &amp; Cruelty-Free Commitment</span><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></button><div class="about3-ethic-panel">Promote clearly disclosed products that avoid animal testing and animal-derived ingredients where possible.</div></div>
      <div class="about3-ethic"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="about3-ethic-num">06</span><span class="about3-ethic-title">Circular Economy &amp; Upcycling</span><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></button><div class="about3-ethic-panel">Encourage upcycling, repairability and repurposing that extend resource life and reduce waste.</div></div>
      <div class="about3-ethic"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="about3-ethic-num">07</span><span class="about3-ethic-title">Environmental Responsibility</span><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></button><div class="about3-ethic-panel">Reduce emissions, water consumption and plastic use while protecting ecosystems and biodiversity.</div></div>
      <div class="about3-ethic"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="about3-ethic-num">08</span><span class="about3-ethic-title">Transparency &amp; Traceability</span><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></button><div class="about3-ethic-panel">Help customers understand where products come from, how they are made and who makes them.</div></div>
      <div class="about3-ethic"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="about3-ethic-num">09</span><span class="about3-ethic-title">Inclusive Growth &amp; Community Development</span><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></button><div class="about3-ethic-panel">Create opportunity for women-led enterprises, social enterprises and underrepresented communities.</div></div>
      <div class="about3-ethic"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="about3-ethic-num">10</span><span class="about3-ethic-title">Responsible Collaboration &amp; Innovation</span><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></button><div class="about3-ethic-panel">Use technology and business innovation to create positive outcomes with honest communication.</div></div>
      <div class="about3-ethic"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="about3-ethic-num">11</span><span class="about3-ethic-title">Give Back to the Planet</span><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></button><div class="about3-ethic-panel">Support restoration, biodiversity conservation, artisan welfare and community development.</div></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

